    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Mango\u2019s Fisharium</strong></u> is a short incremental game about catching fishes and display it on the Fish Aquarium.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Mango to build the biggest and coolest Fisharium ever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>=== Capture fish in the ocean\u00a0===</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697890/extras/9ff7ee199d61d291ca2325a93a7da0c4.poster.avif?t=1750913231\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697890/extras/9ff7ee199d61d291ca2325a93a7da0c4.webm?t=1750913231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697890/extras/9ff7ee199d61d291ca2325a93a7da0c4.mp4?t=1750913231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>=== </strong>Display your fish in the Fisharium<strong>\u00a0===</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697890/extras/8ce78312ad8d108950ac2750f46ad440.poster.avif?t=1750913231\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697890/extras/8ce78312ad8d108950ac2750f46ad440.webm?t=1750913231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697890/extras/8ce78312ad8d108950ac2750f46ad440.mp4?t=1750913231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>=== </strong>Upgrade your tools\u00a0<strong>\u00a0===</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697890/extras/39c959f1ac2d7e19513b96695328791b.poster.avif?t=1750913231\" width=590 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697890/extras/39c959f1ac2d7e19513b96695328791b.webm?t=1750913231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697890/extras/39c959f1ac2d7e19513b96695328791b.mp4?t=1750913231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ fishing locations</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ fish to collect</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All fish have their Shiny version (different color palettes)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short gameplay (~4 hours of playtime)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Really big and satisfying numbers!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[incrementaldb_verification: Evrac88]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697890/extras/67396f7328ace7961c48bac08d0c88f7.poster.avif?t=1750913231\" width=600 height=86 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697890/extras/67396f7328ace7961c48bac08d0c88f7.webm?t=1750913231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697890/extras/67396f7328ace7961c48bac08d0c88f7.mp4?t=1750913231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Mango\u2019s Fisharium</strong></u> is a short incremental game about catching fishes and display it on the Fish Aquarium.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Mango to build the biggest and coolest Fisharium ever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>=== Capture fish in the ocean\u00a0===</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697890/extras/9ff7ee199d61d291ca2325a93a7da0c4.poster.avif?t=1750913231\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697890/extras/9ff7ee199d61d291ca2325a93a7da0c4.webm?t=1750913231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697890/extras/9ff7ee199d61d291ca2325a93a7da0c4.mp4?t=1750913231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>=== </strong>Display your fish in the Fisharium<strong>\u00a0===</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697890/extras/8ce78312ad8d108950ac2750f46ad440.poster.avif?t=1750913231\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697890/extras/8ce78312ad8d108950ac2750f46ad440.webm?t=1750913231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697890/extras/8ce78312ad8d108950ac2750f46ad440.mp4?t=1750913231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>=== </strong>Upgrade your tools\u00a0<strong>\u00a0===</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697890/extras/39c959f1ac2d7e19513b96695328791b.poster.avif?t=1750913231\" width=590 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697890/extras/39c959f1ac2d7e19513b96695328791b.webm?t=1750913231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697890/extras/39c959f1ac2d7e19513b96695328791b.mp4?t=1750913231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ fishing locations</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ fish to collect</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All fish have their Shiny version (different color palettes)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short gameplay (~4 hours of playtime)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Really big and satisfying numbers!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[incrementaldb_verification: Evrac88]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697890/extras/67396f7328ace7961c48bac08d0c88f7.poster.avif?t=1750913231\" width=600 height=86 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697890/extras/67396f7328ace7961c48bac08d0c88f7.webm?t=1750913231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697890/extras/67396f7328ace7961c48bac08d0c88f7.mp4?t=1750913231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
